            {
                "entry_id": "edc4e6a9-55cf-3ae2-aa06-05b74057f5b6",
                "word": "biromantique",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "b1466f9c-f97b-4f60-b109-81495ffa932f",
                        "entry_id": "edc4e6a9-55cf-3ae2-aa06-05b74057f5b6",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "biromantiques"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8147fc07-6cb7-387c-8fd8-d735f2a23351",
                        "entry_id": "edc4e6a9-55cf-3ae2-aa06-05b74057f5b6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui est attiré sentimentalement par les hommes autant que par les femmes."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "LGBTQ"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "618937d3-45ff-49b7-91c1-b823f237c81f",
                                "sense_id": "8147fc07-6cb7-387c-8fd8-d735f2a23351",
                                "text": "Il me faudra je le sais, du monde toute la volonté\nPour ces désirs ardents, me sacrifier\nAfin de connaître l'enfantement tant désiré\nSuis-je hétéroromantique ou biromantique ?\nHomoromantique ou juste agnostique ?\nMes amies pensent que je suis une pan-romantique."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f605bf86-18af-4f53-ac85-f98b27a1eea3",
                        "source_entry_id": "edc4e6a9-55cf-3ae2-aa06-05b74057f5b6",
                        "source_sense_id": "8147fc07-6cb7-387c-8fd8-d735f2a23351",
                        "target_lang_word": "biromantic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "biromantic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "037b7a1e-6cf5-373b-9773-0aff42971efd",
                                        "entry_id": "a2e0b65f-6cdd-3848-a332-5fd87e621b22",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Romantically attracted to both males and females."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5e789373-d7a1-4447-ad98-2e79882c1821",
                                                "sense_id": "037b7a1e-6cf5-373b-9773-0aff42971efd",
                                                "text": "Now that he's thought longer about it, Michael also likes to describe himself as \"biromantic\". He is keen to have a romantic relationship with either a man or a woman."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d9d12722-9e71-4edc-9509-9c0e45948aee",
                                                "sense_id": "037b7a1e-6cf5-373b-9773-0aff42971efd",
                                                "text": "So, for example, it is not unusual for an asexual person to say that he is asexual but bi'''romantic, or that she is asexual but heteroromantic."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "01688bdd-86f5-4830-ae06-e97578430622",
                                                "sense_id": "037b7a1e-6cf5-373b-9773-0aff42971efd",
                                                "text": "Though some people identify as aromantic, others identify as heteromantic, homoromantic, biromantic and everything in between."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "biromantic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a8c95af2-4999-3946-8596-d0fc1e28db08",
                                        "entry_id": "14550be6-b46b-3890-8d4c-fa6d22507cde",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who is romantically attracted to both males and females."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0b6be7ff-c318-4e6c-b0af-c046bfa13b67",
                                                "sense_id": "a8c95af2-4999-3946-8596-d0fc1e28db08",
                                                "text": "Within this group of romantic asexuals, orientation varies: heteroromantics only feel romantic attraction to the opposite sex, homoromantics to the same sex, biromantics to both sexes and panromantics without reference to sex or gender."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "886fb67a-15b4-41f7-bde8-8ba694874790",
                                                "sense_id": "a8c95af2-4999-3946-8596-d0fc1e28db08",
                                                "text": "For my part, I decided this year not to mention allies in the laundry list of identities represented (I also didn't mention heteroflexible biromantics), underscoring the Sisyphean task of creating an inclusive list of identities."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "17dc753d-3af0-45d6-8ead-c283fcf65313",
                                                "sense_id": "a8c95af2-4999-3946-8596-d0fc1e28db08",
                                                "text": "Panromantics, unlike biromantics, will tend to feel that their partner's gender does little to define their relationship."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3786f5f4-82a5-48a6-96e5-f317440dd01d",
                        "source_entry_id": "edc4e6a9-55cf-3ae2-aa06-05b74057f5b6",
                        "source_sense_id": "8147fc07-6cb7-387c-8fd8-d735f2a23351",
                        "target_lang_word": "bi",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "bi",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b98a00ee-3168-3609-bb90-aa2c7f25e673",
                                        "entry_id": "8a48ced6-c83f-3f35-aed2-cb23751dd3cc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Bisexual."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bea1b934-1bcd-480d-aed0-2765b711ef96",
                                                "sense_id": "b98a00ee-3168-3609-bb90-aa2c7f25e673",
                                                "text": "I'm straight, but my oldest sister is bi."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1ad8160b-a88e-387f-8aa8-8092f522e0ba",
                                        "entry_id": "8a48ced6-c83f-3f35-aed2-cb23751dd3cc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Bigender."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable",
                                            "slang",
                                            "uncommon"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "bi",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b42fb463-96ed-335e-9ad1-ad1ab850179a",
                                        "entry_id": "0500d658-d432-33b8-ab62-b125541d307d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A bisexual person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4357fc92-8488-4ac6-b369-2cab53f1a0ef",
                                                "sense_id": "b42fb463-96ed-335e-9ad1-ad1ab850179a",
                                                "text": "For some reason, I'm feeling _very_ sensitive to bi-discrimination tonight. I'm really not trying to mock the points being made here, it's just that many of the same arguments can be turned around and used to describe the discrimination that bis face."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "15a443ed-26a3-338a-9514-d53011fa220a",
                                        "entry_id": "0500d658-d432-33b8-ab62-b125541d307d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A biceps muscle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial",
                                            "uncommon"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "299ee220-5811-4f13-b33b-edf70d1a5e12",
                                                "sense_id": "15a443ed-26a3-338a-9514-d53011fa220a",
                                                "text": "You cannot train your back without regard to your tris and bis."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "bi",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
